B.alZ=new A.h9("1. Who we are","Tactivo is a football session-planning app operated by Tactivo Limited, company number 17373279, registered in England & Wales at 63 Carlton Road, Erith, DA8 1DX, United Kingdom. Contact us at info@tactivo.co.uk. By using Tactivo you agree to these terms.")
B.amc=new A.h9("2. Who can use it","You must be at least 16 to create an account. Tactivo is built for coaches, not for players: do not use it to store information about children or any other person.")
B.ama=new A.h9("3. Your account","Keep your password to yourself; you are responsible for what happens under your account. Tell us straight away if you think someone else has access to it.")
B.am5=new A.h9("4. Sessions and drills","Session plans are assembled on your device from a library of coach-written drills. They are suggestions, not instructions. You are the coach: you decide what is safe and appropriate for the players in front of you, and you remain responsible for their safety, supervision and wellbeing.")
B.amh=new A.h9("5. Drills you write","Drills and notes you write stay yours. You give us permission to store them and show them back to you inside the app, and nothing more \u2014 we do not publish them or show them to other coaches unless you choose to share one.\n\nDrills you share must be fit for children's football and contain no one's personal details. We may remove any shared drill.")
B.amg=new A.h9("6. What you may not do","Do not use Tactivo unlawfully, do not try to break into or disrupt it, and do not copy the drill library out of the app to republish it elsewhere.")
B.amb=new A.h9("7. Cost","Tactivo is free to use. If we ever introduce paid features we will say so clearly beforehand, and anything you have already saved will stay accessible to you.")
B.am8=new A.h9("8. Ending it","You can delete your account at any time in Settings, which erases your data immediately. We may suspend an account that breaks these terms.")
B.am4=new A.h9("9. Our liability","Tactivo is provided as it is, without a promise that it will always be available or error-free. Nothing in these terms limits our liability for death or personal injury caused by negligence, for fraud, or for anything else that cannot be limited by law.")
B.am0=new A.h9("10. Changes and law","We may update these terms and will change the date above when we do. They are governed by the law of England and Wales.")
